OL,3,GNEWSADoctor circumcised boy 'without
OL,4,Aseeking his opinion'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor circumcised a seven-year-old
OL,7,Fboy without seeking his opinion and
OL,8,Fwithout his father's consent, a medical
OL,9,Ftribunal has heard.
OL,11,FDr Balvinder Mehat is accused of
OL,12,Fmisconduct in relation to the
OL,13,Fcircumcision, which was carried out at
OL,14,FBakersfield Medical Centre in
OL,15,FNottingham.
OL,17,FThe medical tribunal heard the boy was
OL,18,Ftaken to the practice by his mother,
OL,19,Fwho wanted a circumcision for
OL,20,F"spiritual and cultural reasons".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
