OL,3,GNEWSADoctor circumcised boy 'without
OL,4,Aseeking his opinion'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMehat is then alleged to have asked the
OL,7,Fmother to sign a backdated disclaimer
OL,8,Fform after the boy's father complained
OL,9,Fabout the circumcision.
